<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK OCT DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 1.70 BLN.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK OCT DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 1.70 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland said on</p>
<p>Tuesday the required daily money market liquidity balance for</p>
<p>the rest of the month was 1.70 billion markka.</p>
<p>The central bank gave the following figures (FIM mln):</p>
<p> Liquidity estimate for Oct 31			4,900</p>
<p> Minimum reserve requirement for Oct		6,469</p>
<p> Average reserves to Oct 28			   7,081</p>
<p> Required daily balance for remaining period    1,697</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom, +358-9-680 50 245</p>
